OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre traders hit as    
OL,4,Alift and escalators out of use         
OL,6,FTraders at a shopping centre in Runcorn
OL,7,Fsay business has been "badly" affected 
OL,8,Fafter lifts and escalators were out of 
OL,9,Faction for a week.                     
OL,11,FThe outage at the Trident Link Building
OL,12,Fhas left some disabled customers unable
OL,13,Fto access the upper floors.            
OL,15,FColin, director of Electric Art Tattoo,
OL,16,Fsaid clients had been forced to cancel 
OL,17,Fappointments because they could not    
OL,18,Freach his premises.                    
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
