OL,3,GNEWSAShopping centre traders hit as    
OL,4,Alift and escalators out of use         
OL,6,FG Properties, which maintains the      
OL,7,Fbuilding, said the lift and escalators 
OL,8,Fat the building's main entrance had    
OL,9,Fbeen damaged and repairs were being    
OL,10,Farranged.                              
